From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: 2026-10-11
Subject: [PATCH jm-v9 010] panvk: v9 robustBufferAccess2 and nullDescriptor biblioklept

Purpose: Advertise VK_EXT_robustness2 robustBufferAccess2 and
nullDescriptor on v9. Noysz 0071 adds a software bounds check for texel
buffer reads on v9 (LEA_BUF + LD_CVT do not bound the index and get the
missing-alpha value wrong); our csf-v11/122 already has the same check for
arch 9 and 10 (bi_lower_robust_texel_buf, PAN_VA_BUF_CVT_NO_ALPHA in the
buffer descriptor), measured on this G57 with CTS robustness2 buffer cases
2324 pass / 0 fail. SSBO/UBO loads are bounded by LD_PKA, stores and
atomics by nir_lower_robust_access, like v10. Null descriptors are the
Valhall NULL_DESCRIPTOR (Noysz 0045); the v9 vertex path already emits it
for unbound vertex buffers. robustImageAccess2 stays off on v9.
Source/Reference: https://github.com/Noysz/panvk-g99-jm (commit 6ce0d46e419a, MIT; patches/0045-v9-EXPERIMENTAL-robustness2-null-descriptor, 0071-v9-texel-buffer-oob-rba2); texel checks from csf-v11/122
Tested GPU: build-checked; device run on Mali-G57 MC2 (Lenovo TB336FU, gpu_id 0x90930010) pending, see worklogs/v9-jm/PROGRESS.md
Tested Kbase UAPI: JM 11.38
Mesa base range: 5a07217f + g615-v11-csf series + jm-v9 001-006
Dependencies: csf-v11/122 (texel buffer bounds checks)
Validation test: PanProbe robustness2; worklogs/driver-remaining/122-robustbufferaccess2-v10.md

---
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index 67320af..eb230c3 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -211,7 +211,7 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_extensions)(
       .EXT_queue_family_foreign = true,
       .EXT_rasterization_order_attachment_access = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
       .EXT_rgba10x6_formats = PAN_ARCH >= 11,
-      .EXT_robustness2 = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
+      .EXT_robustness2 = PAN_ARCH >= 9,
       .EXT_sampler_filter_minmax = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
       .EXT_scalar_block_layout = true,
       .EXT_separate_stencil_usage = true,
@@ -648,9 +648,11 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_features)(
       .pipelineExecutableInfo = true,
 
       /* VK_KHR_robustness2 */
-      .robustBufferAccess2 = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
+      /* v9/v10 texel buffers get software bounds checks
+       * (bi_lower_robust_texel_buf), the rest is the same Valhall path. */
+      .robustBufferAccess2 = PAN_ARCH >= 9,
       .robustImageAccess2 = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
-      .nullDescriptor = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
+      .nullDescriptor = PAN_ARCH >= 9,
 
       /* VK_EXT_shader_tile_image */
       .shaderTileImageColorReadAccess = PAN_ARCH >= 9,
